<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda kuli vaka Efeso vausonekele ha ntsimbu imo na mukanda ua vaka Kolose mu miaka makumi atanu nalimo (60) Hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu;</para>
  <para style="io1">Muka kusoneka naliambulula vavenia kupua kanganda Paulu (1:1) Vaka kulilongesa cikuma ha cuma cimo vanatava nguavo Paulu ikeye uasonekele Efeso cipue ngoco ou mukanda kuuesi na cihindu ca vavenia cije ciuaniua mu livulu lia Kolose. Muafua hacifua eci camoneka ngue vausonekele linga uzenguluke mu vikungulukilo vimo vili Munganda. Paulu atumbula naua nguendi uakele mu kamenga omo uasonekele ou mukanda (3:1, 4:1, 6:20) Paulu uahanene mukanda kuli Tatikikase kuya nauo ha vungenzi vuendi kukamona cikungulukilo caku Efeso 6:21-22</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso yapuile Nganda yakama ya vaka Loma hakati ka vinganda via vindende viamu cihela ca Asiya. Efeso yevuikile cikuma muafua vatungile cihela cakama ca kulemesela Kamponia ua va Ngelengu ua mpuevo Atamisi Vilinga 19:23-31 Cikungulukilo ca Efeso caputukile vuino ha kutualelelaho ca hilukilile munima Kusolola 2:1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu ali nakulumbununa ha mbazuvuila ya kulivanga ya mukanda ou omo muje Njambi ua hanguile vantu vendi na kuvakonekela ku vupi vuavo kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu. Ali nakusetekesa cikungulukilo ku muvila na Kilistu kupua ikeye mutue ua muvila na cisimi cakama ca mu mbango ya njivo. Mu mbazuvuila ya mucivali ya mukanda Paulu ahana mashiko mu vanapande kuyoyela mu vuka Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mukapetulu 1-2 Paulu aliambulula vavenia na kumeneka va Efeso.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Kaha alumbununa vu sepa vua cikungulukilo na Kilistu 1:3; 3:21</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kaha Paulu ali nakusoneka ha ngila ivanapande kuyoyelamo vaka Kilistu 4:1; 6:20</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hakumanusula Paulu ahandeka amo mezi akushoka 6:21-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Yange Paulu, kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu ku cizango ca Njambi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ku vantu vakulela va Njambi vaje naua vapua vakulongua muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale kuli yeni vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo viamu Cimbembesi muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Tulemeseni Njambi ikeye Ishe ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. Muomu mukulipandakana cetu na Kilistu natukuisula navikuisulo vioshe via Cimbembesi mu vihela via muilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Tele kanda vapange mavu, Njambi uatuhanguile laja linga tupue vendi muli Kilistu, tupue vakulela na vakuhona mulonga ku mesho endi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Muomu ya cizango cendi, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Njambi uayonguelele kulutue ngeci kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu akatupuisa kupua vana vendi. Eci capuile cakumulema na vutumbe vuendi vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Nkuma tushangazaleni Njambi ou natumuesa kavumbi kendi kakama cikuma muomu ya munendi yazanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Mu maninga a Yesu Kilistu tunapatuka na kutukonekela ku vipi vietu, kuya na vukama vua kavumbi ka Njambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />kaje kanatuhana museteko yakama!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Mukuendelela na mana endi oshe na mukuzivuka coshe. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Njambi ualingile vije uatumbuile kulinga kulutue. Uatusholuelele vutumbe vuendi vua vushueke vuasinganiekele kumanesa kuhitila muli Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Vutumbe ovu vuje Njambi aka vumanesa omo nga ntsimbu ya cili inapuho, akakungulula vioshe via muilu nevi via ha mavu kuhitila muli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Viuma vioshe Njambi uavilingile kuya na vutumbe vuendi. Njambi uatuhanguile kupua tu vantu vendi kuhitila muli Kilistu. Ovu vukevuo vutumbe vuendi vua tumbile hume ha mbangelo. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Yetu vakulivanga kukakala na likulahelo muli Kilistu tushangazaleni vumpau vua Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Neni naua muapuile mu vantu va Njambi omo muazivile lizi lia vusunga, Muzimbu Uacili uje uaminehelele kuovoka. Muatsilielele muli Kilistu, Kaha Njambi namihaka cimueso cakupua muvendi hakumihana Cimbembesi Uakulela uje uamikulahesele. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Cimbembesi ikeye natulingisa cili vene tukasuana vije Njambi nakulahesa vantu vendi, kaha tunasimpi ngeci Njambi a kapatula vantu vendi. Tushangazaleni vumpau vuendi!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ha cuma eci, muomu njinevu lutsilielo lueni muli Muene Yesu, na cizango ceni ku vantu voshe vakulela va Njambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />kunjalikelele kutsantsela kuli Njambi muomu yeni. Ntsimbu yoshe njikamilombelela. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Njitualelelaho kulomba ngeci Njambi ua Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, Tate ua vumpau amihane Cimbembesi ca mana neci cakusholola linga mu muzivuke muacili. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Njili na kulomba ngeci mesho eni va emuise linga muzivuke kutsiliela cije civanamisanena na vufuko vua vumpau vuendi vuje vuva kasuana vantu vendi vakulela. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Naua njikalombo nguange muzivuke nzili yendi yakama kuli yetu vaka kutsiliela. Ije nzili ipanga muli yetu inapu ngue nzili yakama ije, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />uapangesele omo uasanguile Kilistu ku vatsi nakumutumbika ku livoko liendi lia cilio mu cifuti ca muilu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kuje Kilistu ikeye muka kushika helu lia voshe vaka kushika muilu, vaka nzili yakama na vaka nzili na vimiene voshe, ikeye ali na lizina lili helu lia mazina oshe a nzili yakama aje aliko hano vene na aje akeja. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Njambi nahana nzili yoshe muli Kilistu nakumupuisa mutue ua vioshe mu cikungulukilo. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Cikungulukilo cinapu muvila ua Kilistu, na cikungulukilo cinashulu ikeye na ikeye nashulisisa vioshe.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhuma ku kutsa kuya ku muono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Laja muapuile mu vatsi ku Cimbembesi muomu ku muononokele Njambi, nakulinga vupi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ha ntsimbu ije muakavangeyele vingila via vupi via ha mavu, muononokele muka kuyula ua vimbembesi via vinzili via muvukambuila ikeye honi Cimbembesi uje ali nakuendesa vantu vaje kuvononoka Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Muavusunga vene tuva voshe tuafuile ngue vakevo ha ntsimbu imo, kaha tuayoyele vene ngue ku cisemua ca mashungu etu a vuntu. Tualingile vije vuntu vuetu na visinganieka via vuntu viakele nakutonda. Muomu ku cisemua cetu ca vuntu ngue vantu voshe, tuapandele kuyanda ku vutenu vua Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Vuno honi Njambi uapua ua cikeketima cikuma, kaha na cizango cendi hali yetu capua cakama cikuma, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ngeci omo tuatsile mu Cimbembesi muomu yakuhona kuononoka cetu, kaha uatunehele ku muono hamo na Kilistu. Kaha munovoka ha ngozi ya Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Hakukala hamo na Kilistu Yesu, Njambi uatusanguile hamo nendi ngeci tukayule hamo nendi muilu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ualingile evi kupua cimueso ku vintsimbu vioshe vije vikeja ha kumuesa vukama vua kavumbi kendi mu cizango cije catumuesele kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Munovoka muomu ya kavumbi ka Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo. Eci keti ngue ha vilinga vieni houe, vuno honi cinapu vuana vua Njambi, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />keti ngue ku vipangi vieni. Kuteua muntu umo akalihalesa. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Yetu tunapu vakutanga kuli Njambi, kaha hakukala hamo na Kilistu Yesu Njambi uatutangelele yetu kulinga vipangi viacili, vije via tuvuaheselele laja ngeci tuyoye mu cifua eci vene.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vumo muli Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nankuma vulukeni ha ntsimbu imo yeni keti Vayunda ku cisemua, vaje vavatumbula nguavo “Vakakuhona kulovoka” kuli Vayunda, vaje valitumbula vakevo vavenia nguavo vaka kulovoka eci cikeco cije civakalingi vamala ku mivila yavo. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Ha ntsimbu ije muashondolokele kuli Kilistu. Muapuile muvangenzi ku muakundamene ku vantu Vaisaleli vaje Njambi uahanguile. Kumuakele na mutambela mu matavasano, aje emanene ha vikulaheso via Njambi ku vantu vendi, kaha yeni muayoyele hano ha mavu kua kuhona kutsiliela na kuhona Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Vuno honi kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu yeni vaje muakele kulahako na Njambi ha ntsimbu imo, vanamineha muyehi na njambi kuhitila mu maninga a Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Muomu Kilistu natunehela ciyulo hakulinga Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda kupua vantu vamo. Uahanene muvila uendi kupua nkombelo, ya kupujula civumbe cije cavatepesele na kuvapuisa vitozi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Uamanusuile lishiko lia Vayunda hamo nakushika kualio na futisi yalio, ualingile eci ngeci vivunga vivali via vantu vipue civunga cimolika mukukala hamo nendi, ngeci kukale ciyulo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kuhitila ha kutsa cendi ha cilindakano Kilistu uanongesele vizindo viavo. Kuhitila ha cilindakano napandakana vivunga vivali nakuvipuisa muvila umolika nakuvahiluisa naua kuli Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Kilistu uezile nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua ciyulo kuli voshe, kuli yeni keti Vayunda vaje vakele kulahako na Njambi na kuli Vayunda vaje vakele kuyehi na Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Kuhitila muli Kilistu yetu voshe, Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda, tuasa kuija ku mesho a Tate mu Cimbembesi umo.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nankuma, yeni keti Vayunda kumuapuile honi naua vangenzi cipue vinzinda, yenihoni munapu mu vandambo hamo na vantu va Njambi, yenihoni munapu vantu va ntanga ya Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Neni naua vanamitungu ha luvula lua tunganda na tunanguizi, cisimi caseho cikuma ca mu mbango cikeco Kilistu Yesu vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ikeye umo uje muka kukuata njivo yoshe hamolika na kuyikolesa na kuyipuisa njivo yakulela ya Muene. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Muli Yesu yeni vana mitungu mumo na vakueni veka ngeci mupue cihela muje muakala Njambi kuhitila muli Cimbembesi cendi.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Paulu kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ha cuma eci yange Paulu cinzinda ua Kilistu Yesu, omo ya mulonga ueni yeni keti Vayunda njilinakulomba kuli Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Muavusunga vene yeni muazivuka ngueni Njambi mu kavumbi kendi nanjihana vipangi evi via kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Njambi uasholuele vutumbe vuendi vua vushueke nakuvusholola kuli yange. Kuya ngue muje munjinasoneka laja muvundende ha cuma eci. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Kaha nga mutanda vije vinjinasoneka muasa kuvuisisa muje munjikevuisisa vishueka via hali Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Mu vintsimbu via hanima vantu kuva valekele vishueka evi vuno honi Njambi navisholola vuavuno kuhitila muli Cimbembesi kuli tunganda vendi vakulela na tunanguizi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Cishueka eci, capuile ngeci hali lizi lia Muzimbu Uacili, vaje keti Vayunda hano honi vali namutambela hamo na Vayunda mu vikuisulo via Njambi vakevo vanapu muvila umo, na kulipangazela mu cikulaheso ca Njambi cije ca pangele muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Njambi uanjihanene vuana vuakama vua kuambulula mu Muzimbu Uacili. Ualingile eci kuhitila mu nzili yendi ije ilina kupanga muli yange. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Yange njapua nji uamundende kuhiana vantu voshe vakulela va Njambi, vuno honi Njambi ua njihanene vipangi viacili viakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili kuli vaje keti Vayunda ua vufuko vua Kilistu vuje vua kukomouesa. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Uanjihanene naua vipangi via kumuesa vantu voshe vutumbe vua vishueka viendi muje mu vukalingiua. Njambi ikeye samatanga ua vioshe, uashuekele vishueka vuendi ku miaka yoshe ya kunima. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Visinganieka viendi hali evi vioshe viapuile kupangesa cikungulukilo kumuesa vaka kuyula na vaka nzili mu cifuti ca muilu muje vati mana endi muakapangelamo mu vioshe. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Evi vikevio Njambi uasinganiekele hume ha mbangelo kaha uavimanusuile kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu Muene uetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mukukala hamo na Kilistu na kuhitila mu lutsilielo luetu muli ikeye tuasahoni kuija mukusimpa na kutsiliela muli Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Nankuma, njimilomba nguange keti muzeye ha tuyando tuange tuje tunjili nakuuana muomu yeni. Muafuila kuziva kalemeso ngueni njalihana kuyandela viuma evi muomu yeni.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Muomu ya cuma eci njitsikama ha mavuli ange nakulombela kuli Njambi, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />kuli ikeye ntanga yoshe ya hano ha mavu na muilu ili nakutambula lizina lia vusunga, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />njilomba kuli Njambi ha vufuko vua vumpau vuendi ngeci amihane nzili kuhitila muli Cimbembesi cendi linga mukale na nzili mukati ka mitima yeni, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />njilomba nguange Kilistu ayoye mu mitima yeni kuhitila mu lutsilielo. Kaha naua njilomba nguange mizi yeni na luvula lueni lutande mu cizango. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Mu ngila eyi vene yeni hamolika na vantu va Njambi voshe mukakala na nzili ya kuzivuka muacili vukama vua cizango ca Kilistu cakuhona kuhua. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Njilomba nguange muzivuke cizango cendi cipue vene kumuasa kucizivuka muacili. Kaha nga muzivuka cizango cendi mukashulilila na cifua ca Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Njambi asa kulinga vije viuma via kuhiana cikuma mu nzili ije ili nakupanga muli yetu. Asa kupanga mu kuhiana vije vituasa ku mulomba cipue kuhiana vije vituasa kusinganieka. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Kuli Njambi kukale vumpau mu cikungulikilo na muli Kilistu Yesu ku ntsimbu yoshe na ku miaka ya yaye Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Vumo vua muvila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Njili mu kamenga muomu ya kupangela Muene. Njimilomba muyoye muvuyoye vuaku fuilamo vua vantu vaje Njambi nahangula kupua vendi. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ntsimbu yoshe pueni vaka kuononoka na kulikehesa naku vandamena. Mueseni kulikonekela umo na mukuavo mu cizango. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Koleseni kutulika muacili vumolika vuje vuanamihana Cimbembesi kuhitila mu ciyulo cije cinamikutu hamolika. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuli muvila umolika na Cimbembesi umolika, ngue muje vene kuakala lika kutsiliela cimolika cije Njambi namisanena. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kuli lika Muene umo, na lutsilielo lumo, na kumbuitika cimo. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Kuli Njambi umo ikeye Ishe ya voshe, Muene ua voshe, uapanga mu voshe kaha ali mu voshe.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Umo na umo hali yetu voshe natambula vuana vuacili kusetekesa ku vije Kilistu uahanguile kupangezela. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ngue muvihandeka visoneka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Omo ikeye ualondele kuya ku cihela cakulahako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Uambatele vinzinda vavengi hamo nendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Nakuhana mavuana ku vantu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Nkuma mezi aua ahandeka nguauo, “Ikeye ualondele kuya ku cihela cakulahako” alumbununa vika? Cinalumbunuka ngeci ha kulivanga uashulukile muintsi lia mavu akulova. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Uje uashulukile muintsi lia mavu, ikeye naua umolika uje ualondele muilu lia melu oshe linga ashulise mavu oshe na ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Kilistu ikeye uje uahanene mavuana, uahanguile vamo kupua tunganda, vamo kupua tunanguizi, vakuavo vapuile vaka kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili, veka naua kupua tuniungi na valongisi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ualingile evi muku vuahesela vantu va Njambi voshe ngeci vapange cipangi ca vuka Kilistu, mukutunga muvila ua Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Eci cikatualelelaho noho tuva voshe tukapua vantu vamolika mu lutsilielo luetu na mu mana etu a Muna Njambi, tukapua vantu vakukola mumana na kuheta ha seteko ya kumanusula ya Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kaha kutukapuho ngue tuvanike naua. Kutukatavesa vaka makuli kutukuisa na vilongesa via makuli vije viakufua ngue mankimba na mpunzi vije vitupekumuna. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Vuno honi ha kuhandeka vusunga na cizango, tukakola mu vingila vioshe ngue Kilistu uje napu mutue. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Hali ikeye vilio via muvila vioshe vinali nungakana hamolika kaha muvila uoshe unalikuata hamo mu manunga. Muvila unakolo na kulitunga ukeuo vavenia mu cizango kuya ku mbazuvuila mu ikapangelamo cipangi cayo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muono uauha muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Mu lizina lia Muene, njiminangula keti muyoye ngue vantu vaje kuvazivuka Njambi, vaje viyongola viavo viapua viangoco, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />kaha kuvuisisa cavo cili mu milima. Vakevo kuvesi na mutambela mu muono uje uakahana Njambi muomu vakevo vali kunzimba na mu kukaluuisa mitima yavo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Vakevo kuvesi nashuamua yahi. Vana liecelela na kulinga viuma via vupangala kaha vali na lizangamena lia kutualelelaho kulinga viuma evi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Muje keti mukemo mu muali longeselelemo hali Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Muavusunga yeni muevua laja via hali ikeye kaha ha kupua vaka kumukava vamilongesele vusunga vuje vuli muli Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Vamilongesele kuseza vuntu vueni vua laja vuje vuakele naku miyoyesa muje mu muakele. Vuje vuntu vueni vua laja vavunongesele ha mashungu eni aje amakuli. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Visinganieka vieni vinapande kupua via viha. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Kaha munapande kuzala vuntu vua vuha vuje vuva napanga mu cifua ca Njambi. Ovu vuntu vua vuha vunapu vua vusunga cikuma na kulela.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nankuma keti muhandeke makuli naua! Muntu na muntu napande kuhandeka vusunga kuli mukuavo muomu yetu tuva voshe tunapu vilio via mu muvila ua Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nga muniengua keti mutave kuniengua ceni cimituale ku vupi, kaha keti mutokese litangua mu kuniengua lika houe. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Keti mutave kuhana Liyavolo cihela. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Muntu uje uevile kapandele naua kuiva vuno honi aputuke kuononoka na kupanga cikuma linga akale nacimo ca kukuasa vihutu.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Keti mulikuasese mezi akupihia omo muhandeka, vuno honi likuaseseni mezi acili aje asakutunga vantu kuya kuli vivana honoua ngeci vioshe vimuhandeka vikapue viacili kuli vaje voshe vamivuilila. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Kaha keti mupihilise Cimbembesi Uakulela ua Njambi. Muomu Cimbembesi Uakulela ua Njambi uapua cimueso ca Njambi uakumimuesa ngue muakundama kuli ikeye. Cimbembesi Uakulela napu cikulaheso ngeci omo litangua lia kumanusuila likeja kaha Njambi aka mipatula. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Humiseni vizindo vioshe na vutenu. Keti kukale kuniengua na kulicokota cipue kulituka umo na mukuavo na matumbe amapi mukati keni. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Vuno honi pueni vaka ngozi na vaka cikeketima kuli umo na mukuavo. Lisambueseni umo na mukuavo ngue muana mikonekela Njambi kuhitila muli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuyoya mu ceke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Munapande kutemunuisa Njambi muomu muapua vana vendi vakumuya ku mutima. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Yoyeni vuyoye vua cizango ngue omo Kilistu ua tuzangele na kulilambuila ikeye vavenia hali yetu ngue nkombelo ya luengo luacili kuli Njambi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Keti muhane vakueni visinganieka via kuhandeka ngue kuli vupangala, viuma via mazilo na lizangamena hakati keni, muomu viuma evi keti viacili ku vilinga ku vantu vakulela va Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ku muapandele kuhandeka mezi ashuamua cipue a vulema ku vantu cipue kuhandeka likehelela lia mazilo. Evi keti viuma viacili kuli yeni vuno honi munapande lika kusantsela Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Munapande kuzivuka ngueni uoshe alinga vupangala, cipue muntu ua mazilo cipue ua lizangamena kakasuana Vumuene vua Kilistu novu vua Njambi. Uoshe alinga lizangamena alemesa tumponia.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Keti mutave umo amikuise na mezi a mupulungua, muomu ha viuma evi vukalu vua Njambi vukakala hali vaje vaka kujeneka kuononoka. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nankuma keti mulipandakane hamo navo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Ha ntsimbu imo muakele mu milima vuno honi muomu munapu mu vantu va Muene muli mu ceke. Munapande kuyoya ngue vantu vali mu ceke. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Ceke cikeco cikakuneha kuteja kuakama ca kusungama na vusunga. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Lilongeseni vije vivuahelesa Muene. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Keti muambateko mutambela ku viuma viangoco vije viva kalingi vantu, viuma vije vinakundama ku milima vuno honi vishololeni ku ceke. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Cinapu ca shuamua cipue kuhandeka viuma vije vivalinga mu vushueke. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Omo viuma vioshe visholoka mu ceke, ambahoni vusunga vuacifua cavio vukasholoka, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />nankuma mukemo vahandeka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Yeni vaka kukosa hindukeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Sangukeni ku vatsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">kaha Kilistu akatuila ceke cendi hali yeni.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Nankuma, nangukeni mu mulina kuyoyelamo. Keti muyoye ngue vaka kuhona mana vuno honi ngue vaka mana. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Pangeseni muacili vintsimbu vije mulinavio, muomu matangua ano anapu a mapi <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nankuma keti mupue ngue vilema, vuno honi ivuisiseni vije viazanga Muene ngeci mucipange.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Keti mupende na viniu vije viasa kumipihisa, vuno honi shuleni na Cimbembesi ua Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Handekeni kuli umo na nukuavo na mezi a miaso ya Visamo na miaso yakulela. Imbeni miaso na kushangazala Muene mu mitima yeni. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Ntsimbu yoshe tsantseleni kuli Njambi Tatetu mu viuma vioshe mu lizina lia Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamala vakuambata na vampuevo vakushomboka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Lihaneni kuli umo na mukuavo muomu yakusingimika Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Vampuevo vakushomboka lihaneni kuli vamala veni, ngue muje mu mukalihana kuli Muene. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Yala ali na nzili yakama hali mpueyendi, ngue omo Kilistu ali na nzili yakama ha cikungulukilo. Kilistu vavenia ikeye muyoyesi ua cikungulukilo cije cikeco muvila uendi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Vampuevo vakushomboka vanapande kulihana kuli vamala vavo mu vioshe, ngue cikungulukilo mucikalihana kuli Kilistu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Vamala vakuambata, zangeni vampuevo veni ngue Kilistu muazangela cikungulukilo, kaha uahanene muono uendi hali cikeco. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Ualingile evi mukuhana cikungulukilo kuli Njambi kuhitila mu mezi endi, hanima ya kucilelesa mukucikusha mu mema. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />linga akahane cikungulukilo mesho endi mu vumpau vuaco vuoshe, kuakuhona katoma cipue kapenga kamo cipue ceka ha viuma evi, vuno honi mukulela cipue mukuhona mulonga. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Mu ngila eyi vene vamala vakuambata vanapande kuzanga vampuevo vavo ngue muvakazangela mivila yavo vavenia. Yala uje azanga mpueyendi alizanga ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Naumo uahi uazinda muvila uendi vavenia. Vuno honi aulisa naku ulela ngue Kilistu vene muakalingi ku cikungulukilo, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />muomu tunapu vilio via muvila uendi. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ngue muvihandeka visoneka nguavio, “Ha cuma eci vene yala akaseza ishe na ina naku lipandakana na mpueyendi, kaha voshe vavali vakapua muvila umo.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Kuli cisinkiko cakulova ca vusunga mu visoneka evi, njili nakuhandeka hali via Kilistu na cikungulukilo. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Vuno honi cinenika yeni naua, yala uoshe napande kuzanga mpueyendi ngue mualizanga ikeye vavenia, kaha mpuevo uoshe napande kusingimika yaliendi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Vana na visemi vavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Yeni vana ononokeni kuli visemi veni muomu muakundama kuli Muene. Eci cikeco cuma cacili kucilinga. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Singimika isho na noko.” Eli likelio Lishiko lia kulivanga muje Njambi uakulaheselemo cuma cimo. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Eci cikeco cakulahesele, “Nga usingimika visemi vove viuma vioshe vikapua viacili kuli yove mu vuyoye vuove kaha ukayoya ntsimbu yakama hano ha mavu.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Yeni visemi keti muyandese vana veni. Omo mu valela valongeseni mu vilongesa via Muene.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vangamba na vamiene vavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Yeni vangamba, ononokeni vamiene veni va hano ha mavu. Lingeni eci na mitima ya kasingimiko kavusunga, ngue vene mulina kupangela Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Lingeni eci keti omo valina kumitalelela, muomu mutonda kuvuahesa ku mitima yavo, vuno honi na mitima yeni yoshe lingeni vije viatonda Njambi, ngue vangamba va Kilistu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Lingeni vipangi vieni via vungamba nakujolela, ngue mulina kupangela Muene, keti ngue vantu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Zivukeni ngueni Muene akafueta muntu na muntu, cipue ngamba cipue ua kupatuka, ha vipangi viendi viacili vianalingi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Neni vamiene, lingeni naua cuma cimo kuli vangamba veni muku vapangesa muacili, keti muva teuese. Zivukeni ngueni yeni na vangamba veni muva voshe muli kuli Muene umolika ali muilu, uje kakele nacivembulu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vitua via Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Hakumanusuila, koleseni muli Muene na mu nzili ya vukama vuendi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Zaleni ku vitua vioshe vije Njambi namihana linga cimiasiuise mukukolesa mukulua na matumbe a Liyavolo. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Omo yetu kutuesi nakulua na vantu vuno honi tulina kulua na vimbembesi via nzili via mu vukambuila, na vaka kushika, na vaka nzili yakama na vinzili ya ha mavu ya milima. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nankuma zaleni vitua vioshe via Njambi, ambahoni omo litangua lia vupi likeja cikamiasiuisa kuliohiela ku citozi kaha cipue muna manusula kuliohiela hanga mukemana ngoo.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Nankuma kaleni na kulivuahesela kaha likuteni vusunga ngue muiva mu vimbunda vieni. Zaleni kulongua cije cikeco cikapua ngue ntelo ya kuohiela vintulo vieni. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Zaleni mu vinkaku mukulivuahesela vualumo mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua ciyulo. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ntsimbu yoshe ambateni lutsilielo ngue ntelo. Omo yevi lika mukasa kuzima mivi ya tuhia ije yalina kuasha Satana. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ambateni kuovoka kupua litepa lieni na lizi lia Njambi ngue mukuale uje uvanamihana ku Cimbembesi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Lombeleni mu kulinga viuma evi, lombeni vukuasi kuli Njambi. Ntsimbu yoshe lombeleni ngue omo Cimbembesi mu cimituamenena. Mu cifua eci pueni vakuli vuahesela kaha keti muecele. Lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe ha vantu voshe va Njambi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Nange naua munjikundikeko, linga Njambi anjihane mezi acili omo njihandeka linga njambulule nakusimpa na kusholola vushueke vua Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Njimu kakuimanena ua Kilistu linga njambulule ou Muzimbu Uacili cipue vene njili mu kamenga. Lombeleni linga njisimpe mu kuhandeka ngue mucina fuilamo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu viakumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Njili nakutuma kuli yeni Tatikikase muanetu ituazanga naua ngamba yetu uakulongua mu vipangi via Muene! Akamihana muzimbu uoshe uahali yanga muzivuke ngueni vati njina hindukilamo. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Omu mukemo njili nakumutuma kuli yeni, linga akamileke vati yetu voshe mutuna hindukila na kukolesa mitima yeni.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vahane kuli yeni vaka kutsiliela ciyulo na cizango mu kutsiliela. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Cikeketima ca Njambi cikale na voshe vaje vazanga Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na cizango ca ku miaka yoshe.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>